  "changes": [
    "New Presentation offers forty editable authored scenes, including six paper-ink titles and six science-fiction titles/credits, plus the four familiar spatial scenes, Original Canvas and an empty scene. The editor can open a separate project or import an independent scene.",
    "Circle of Breath and the other Sumi Ink starters store timed brush paths, text and a local score in the document. Starfield Crawl combines separate editable prologue and credit lines with perspective foreshortening and an original chamber score.",
    "Effects → Motion adds editable animation to the selected visual layer at the current scene time. Preset duration is limited to the visible layer interval.",
    "The timeline transport reserves twelve points below the entire slider while keeping the playback controls balanced above the track."
  ],
